WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.222
Start with the saved draft-only proposal prototype.

00:00:03.222 --> 00:00:07.826
Write the expected response for each test before running it.

00:00:07.826 --> 00:00:11.048
Use normal, missing-information, conflicting-specification, and outside-scope inputs.

00:00:11.048 --> 00:00:17.032
AI suggestions can help design cases, but only actual runs supply test evidence.
